%!PS
%
% 2x2 Cluster-Dot Green Noise FM Screening for Color Laser Printers
% Eliminates single-pixel toner starvation on HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw etc.
% Density calibrated: gamma = 0.85
%
/GreenNoiseFM <<
  /HalftoneType 5
  /Cyan <<
    /HalftoneType 3
    /Width 128
    /Height 128
    /Thresholds <>
  >>
  /Magenta <<
    /HalftoneType 3
    /Width 128
    /Height 128
    /Thresholds <>
  >>
  /Yellow <<
    /HalftoneType 3
    /Width 128
    /Height 128
    /Thresholds <>
  >>
  /Black <<
    /HalftoneType 3
    /Width 128
    /Height 128
    /Thresholds <>
  >>
>> def
GreenNoiseFM /Default GreenNoiseFM /Black get put
GreenNoiseFM /Gray GreenNoiseFM /Black get put
/Default GreenNoiseFM /Halftone defineresource sethalftone
